('gate-puzzler','advanced','F(A,B,C,D) = Σm(0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7) simplifies to what?',ARRAY['A''','A','B''','D'''],0,'m0-m7 = A''(B''+B)(C''+C)(D''+D) = A''.',20),
